# Goal Model for Food Delivery and Dish Retrieval in a Hospital Setting

## Goal Table

| Goal ID | Goal Title                 | Text                                                                                     | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type       | Relation |
|--------|----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------|----------------|----------|
| G1     | Deliver Food and Retrieve Dishes | Ensure food is delivered to patients and dishes are retrieved successfully.          | -                 | Achieve        | -        |
| G2     | Food Delivery              | Successfully deliver food to the inpatient room.                                      | ;                  | Achieve        | G1       |
| G3     | Dish Retrieval             | Successfully retrieve dirty dishes from the inpatient room.                             | ;                  | Achieve        | G1       |
| G4     | Door Opening               | Ensure the door to the inpatient room is opened.                                       | -                 | Achieve        | G1       |
| G2.1   | Direct Delivery            | Deliver food directly to the table in the inpatient room.                               | ;                  | Perform        | G2       |
| G2.2   | Assisted Delivery          | Deliver food with assistance from a human or another robot.                             | FALLBACK(G2.2a, G2.2b) | Perform        | G2       |
| G3.1   | Unassisted Retrieval       | Retrieve dishes without assistance.                                                      | ;                  | Perform        | G3       |
| G3.2   | Assisted Retrieval         | Retrieve dishes with assistance from a human or another robot.                           | FALLBACK(G3.2a, G3.2b) | Perform        | G3       |
| G4.1   | Robot-Only Door Opening    | Open the door using only the robot's capabilities.                                      | -                  | Perform        | G4       |
| G4.2   | Assisted Door Opening      | Open the door with assistance from a human or another robot.                             | FALLBACK(G4.2a, G4.2b) | Perform        | G4       |

